  "rules": {
    "objective": "The highest bidder becomes the declarer and plays alone against the other two. The declarer must either take at least a stated number of tricks or, in misery contracts, lose every trick; the defenders try to prevent the declarer from making the contract.",
    "gameplay": "~40 contract types. KÃ¶pspel=buy cards from talon. Solospel=play hand only. Gaskspel=take entire talon. MisÃ¤rspel=take no tricks. Trump or NT. Follow suit. GÃ¥tt hem=success, GÃ¥tt bet=fail by 1, GÃ¥tt kodilj=fail by 2+.",
